cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these materials, please cite them using the metadata below, and
  cite the haic-libs library they rely on (see references).
type: software
title: "haic-libs RAG demonstration and replication materials"
abstract: >-
  An instrumented Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) chatbot, the question
  sets and decisions artifacts of its evaluation sessions, and scripts that
  recompute the instrumentation-overhead and HAIC-metric tables of the
  haic-libs paper, using haic-metrics 0.3.0 and haic-logging 0.1.0 from PyPI.
